OL,5,G0700 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FIn Essex, Jade and Stuart plan a
OL,7,     Ffun menu, but there's a long wait
OL,8,     Fbetween courses. Mark and Diane
OL,9,     Foffer a taste of the Med and a
OL,10,     Fsing-song. And Chris and Rosella
OL,11,     Fserve up a family recipe.
